#
# fivestar-loader --input-script: answers the first-run screens of an empty save folder unattended, up to the story
# load (docs/running.md#first-run-in-the-game). Times are seconds from loader start. With a warm pipeline cache the
# black "press a button" screen showed 45 to 220 s in. While pipelines compile the game runs at 10 to 20 frames a
# second and can miss a 0.2 s press, so every press here is held 0.3 s or longer.
#
# A tap passes the black screen, skips the logos and confirms each option screen (minimap, text size, the Off
# option, brightness, controls notice); on the legal screen it does nothing while the Legal item has the focus.
40 Space hold 0.3 repeat 91 every 4
# Legal and photosensitivity: focus down twice (the photosensitivity item keeps the focus about 15 s), then Next.
410 Down hold 0.6
430 Down hold 0.6
450 Space hold 0.6
# Privacy policy and terms of service: each item is a check box that A toggles, so one press each. The texts are
# scrolled with the right stick (cursor down at 800 px/s) first, as a player would. Confirm starts the story load.
465 cursor 0 800 hold 30
505 Space hold 0.6
512 Down hold 0.6
520 cursor 0 800 hold 30
560 Space hold 0.6
567 Down hold 0.6
575 Space hold 0.6
